{"after":"e8f691d7f7e2432dbec307f8325ffe15a61b0be1","base_ref":null,"before":"97ddbb969de43ff09ee5395f5cf12adb9ba2aee3","commits":[{"author":{"email":"spica@starry.blue","name":"SlashNephy","username":"SlashNephy"},"committer":{"email":"spica@starry.blue","name":"SlashNephy","username":"SlashNephy"},"distinct":false,"id":"a3c0a1ff508d599e5dc974fb1df729fe54cc4655","message":"feat(AetheryteLinkInChat): prefer Faloop's starting points for hunt spawn points\n\nStraight-line distance on the map ignores terrain, height and walls, so\nthe nearest aetheryte is often not the best one to start from.\n\nFaloop's zone data has the spawn points of hunt marks, each with a\njourneyPoiId that points to the aetheryte or zone boundary to start\nfrom. Embed them (generated by Scripts/generate_hunt_journeys.py) and,\nwhen a map link is at a known spawn point, only consider the routes that\nenter the map at its starting point. Otherwise, fall back to the\nstraight-line distance as before.\n\nRefs #656\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-13T22:02:04+09:00","tree_id":"8c0713ed70486b7a02d70165062ceca122a00fed","url":"https://github.com/SlashNephy/Divination/commit/a3c0a1ff508d599e5dc974fb1df729fe54cc4655"},{"author":{"email":"spica@starry.blue","name":"SlashNephy","username":"SlashNephy"},"committer":{"email":"spica@starry.blue","name":"SlashNephy","username":"SlashNephy"},"distinct":false,"id":"74b495189bf3328cf90cc302abb018e6d7797064","message":"feat(AetheryteLinkInChat): add exits missing from the game's map markers\n\nThe game's map markers do not describe the exit from Yanxia to the\nDoman Enclave (The One River): the marker in Yanxia points to the\nobsolete map 437, and the current map 463 has no marker back to Yanxia.\nSo routes through the Doman Enclave were never considered, which is the\nYanxia example in #656.\n\n- Add MapConnections for such exits, starting with Yanxia <-> the Doman\n  Enclave. Comparing Faloop's boundary starting points with the game's\n  map markers found no other missing exit\n- Consider them in the route calculation as ConnectionTeleportPath,\n  without counting the distance inside the connected map, as where the\n  exit leads to is not known\n- Show them like zone boundaries, and stop the Lifestream teleport there\n\nRefs #656\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-13T22:31:50+09:00","tree_id":"18dc633dae3d9ae2c457e148ce150cd2784ea9e8","url":"https://github.com/SlashNephy/Divination/commit/74b495189bf3328cf90cc302abb018e6d7797064"},{"author":{"email":"spica@starry.blue","name":"SlashNephy","username":"SlashNephy"},"committer":{"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub","username":"web-flow"},"distinct":true,"id":"e8f691d7f7e2432dbec307f8325ffe15a61b0be1","message":"Merge pull request #816 from SlashNephy/feat/alic-hunt-journeys\n\nfeat(AetheryteLinkInChat): prefer Faloop's starting points for hunt spawn points","timestamp":"2026-11-13T23:12:25+09:00","tree_id":"18dc633dae3d9ae2c457e148ce150cd2784ea9e8","url":"https://github.com/SlashNephy/Divination/commit/e8f691d7f7e2432dbec307f8325ffe15a61b0be1"}],"compare":"https://github.com/SlashNephy/Divination/compare/97ddbb969de4...e8f691d7f7e2","created":false,"deleted":false,"forced":false,"head_commit":{"author":{"email":"spica@starry.blue","name":"SlashNephy","username":"SlashNephy"},"committer":{"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub","username":"web-flow"},"distinct":true,"id":"e8f691d7f7e2432dbec307f8325ffe15a61b0be1","message":"Merge pull request #816 from SlashNephy/feat/alic-hunt-journeys\n\nfeat(AetheryteLinkInChat): prefer Faloop's starting points for hunt spawn points","timestamp":"2026-11-13T23:12:25+09:00","tree_id":"18dc633dae3d9ae2c457e148ce150cd2784ea9e8","url":"https://github.com/SlashNephy/Divination/commit/e8f691d7f7e2432dbec307f8325ffe15a61b0be1"},"pusher":{"email":"spica@starry.blue","name":"SlashNephy"},"ref":"refs/heads/master","repository":{"allow_forkin